  "solution": {
    "text": "Differentiate $P V=$ constant w.r.t $V$\r\n$\\Rightarrow P \\Delta V+V \\Delta P=0 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\Delta P}{P}=-\\frac{\\Delta V}{V}$",
